The [[Strong Health Potion]] is a [[Potion]] normally obtained by combining the [[Health Potion]] with a [[Healing Herbs]]. It can also be catalytically crafted from a [[Health Potion]] using the [[Cauldron]], if the player is a [[Reaper]]. It's very similar to the [[Health Potion]], but heals twice as much and gives some {{icon/regeneration}}.

Like all [[Potion]]s, the [[Strong Health Potion]] applies its effect to the [[Potion]] below it when the lower [[Potion]] triggers, or vice versa. The player may want to use a slightly delayed [[Potion]] condition (like another [[Health Potion]]), to ensure that there is health to heal and possibly {{icon/poison}} to cleanse.

The [[Strong Health Potion]] can be catalytically converted into the [[Vampiric Potion]] using the [[Blood Amulet]].
